Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:54.02,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:58.69,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:02.47,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:05.86,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:09.88,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.40,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:13.60,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.04,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:16.94,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.51,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:24.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.01,0:01:31.15,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:35.39,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:39.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.77,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:48.30,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:51.94,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:54.84,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:59.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:03.47,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:10.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.28,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:14.60,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:15.98,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.83,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.87,0:02:21.54,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:25.02,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:34.07,Title,Title,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}同盟的目標與啟程！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.08,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,聽好了，你們這些可惡的海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:40.75,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,油輪可以給你們海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:43.81,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,而這是善與惡之間的界線！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.69,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你們敢越過這條線試試看！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.93,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,聽懂了嗎，草帽海賊團？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:52.65,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:55.48,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,誰叫你做這種荒謬的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.96,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,我只說了別跟海賊太親近。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:03.51,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,既然要做，就該做得徹底，斯莫中將。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:06.23,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,不過這條線對醫療隊不算數。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.23,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,我已經跟G-5基地聯絡上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.80,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,我們在這裡等船來接我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.07,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,是，長官！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:17.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的嗎？！你要自首，布朗比德？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:20.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們才剛成為朋友耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:26.22,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,看樣子，在我們身上做的那些實驗\N是有點毒性的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:29.59,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,只要我們自首就會接受治療。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我懂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:33.23,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,喂喂，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:36.14,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我剛才才叫你別越過這條線！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:37.51,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你到底有沒有在聽我說話？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:38.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我才不管那麼多！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.53,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那是你們自己編出來的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:47.27,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,再說，被凱薩當實驗品之後，坐牢反而還算改善了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:49.99,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,而且我也沒有船員了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:53.25,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,看到你把凱薩轟飛真的很爽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.48,Main,Brownbeard,0,0,0,,非常謝謝你。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:57.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嘿喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好，繼續拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:05.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你早該告訴我我們要把這艘油輪帶走的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:09.72,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,要是我知道之後得修它，我就會換個地方打了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.69,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:17.97,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,在吵什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:19.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.27,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:24.19,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,拜…拜託阻止他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:28.35,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他…他…他是殺人兇手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.55,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,殺人兇手？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.17,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,誰是殺人兇手？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.32,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:36.89,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,托拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:40.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那邊是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:43.15,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我也殺了一個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:46.56,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不，錦右衛門先生本來就已經死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.53,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,但我把他弄壞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.51,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他不只死了，現在還壞掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:54.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他死透又碎掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.80,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那…那…那我們現在該怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果我們把他黏回去，他會沒事嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:00.91,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那哪有用啊，你這白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.06,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.72,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你為什麼還活著？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你為什麼那麼做，香吉士先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:11.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他嚇死我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:13.79,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,明明他好端端的，是你一直在大喊他死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.64,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,喂，看那個。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.03,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,一個本該被瓦斯殺死的人還活著。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:24.77,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,這不是很棒嗎，錦右衛門先生？我原本還以為…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:26.20,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,父親！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.58,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,桃…桃之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.13,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,父親！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.40,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.19,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你還活著真是太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.92,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,父…父親！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,桃之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:53.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這麼說來，\N他確實說過他原本是人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:56.08,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我的兒子，你全身赤裸。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.54,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:08.78,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(550,0)}和之國的孩子（錦右衛門之子）桃之助
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.78,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,100,,{\an8}不愧是和之國的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.84,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你穿和服很好看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.99,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,可是父親，您是怎麼找到…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.26,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:21.63,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,給我出來，羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.81,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:28.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你到底對那些孩子做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果他們出了什麼事，那我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:35.91,Main,Law,0,0,0,,所以我才叫你別看。我只是在…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.57,Main,Law,0,0,0,,切割他們的身體。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:42.71,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他們被餵了麻醉藥。他們的復原會很漫長又艱難，這是無可避免的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.55,Main,Child,0,0,0,,喔，狸貓君！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.82,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,狸貓君！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.81,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你…你們都還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:53.13,Main,Konbu,0,0,0,,那個頭毛毛的傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:56.43,Main,Biyo,0,0,0,,剛剛把我們身體裡所有壞東西都取出來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:58.13,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.74,Main,Doran,0,0,0,,雖然很可怕，但我現在覺得舒服多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:03.75,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,身體變成一塊塊的還挺好玩的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:05.49,Main,Konbu,0,0,0,,我現在肚子餓了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.61,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:10.58,Main,Child,0,0,0,,但摩卡還沒醒過來。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.98,Main,Child,0,0,0,,摩卡是為了幫我們才奮戰的，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:17.78,Main,Child,0,0,0,,我以前都不知道主人是這麼壞的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:22.42,Main,Child,0,0,0,,雖然有點模糊，但我記得\N摩卡吐血然後倒下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.73,Main,Child,0,0,0,,喂，狸貓君。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:25.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,呃，我是馴鹿。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.83,Main,Child,0,0,0,,摩卡會沒事的，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.46,Main,Child,0,0,0,,我們要一起回家，對吧，狸貓君？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:32.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,當然。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.23,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你們要離開這場惡夢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:38.00,Main,Child,0,0,0,,那個橘頭髮的大姐在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.57,Main,Child,0,0,0,,她就是要帶我們回家的人，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:44.03,Main,Child,0,0,0,,我們想謝謝她！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:47.13,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,我們來救這些孩子吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:51.40,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,我怎麼能轉身離開…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.22,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,那些哭著求救的孩子呢？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.39,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,你們好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:02.16,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,從現在起，海軍會照顧你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:05.03,Main,Children,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.46,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,那機器人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.73,Main,Konbu,0,0,0,,那橡膠人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.12,Main,Doran,0,0,0,,那個眉毛捲捲的傢伙呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好香啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:14.71,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不知道香吉士在做什麼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我等不及了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,娜美？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你跟海軍談妥了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:26.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:29.60,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我打算把一切都交給海軍。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.61,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我或許告訴過他們我會救他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:35.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,但我們是海賊，\N那大概會把事情搞複雜。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:42.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是啊，我們大概最後\N會被怪罪是我們綁架了他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,最好把他們交給站在正義那一邊的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:45.59,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你說得對。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:48.09,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:53.95,Flashbacks,Tashigi,0,0,0,,我求求你…\N讓我來照顧這些孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:59.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我就是對女海軍的眼神沒辦法。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,女海軍？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:02.85,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.15,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,她們讓我感到安心。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:10.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,對了，你媽媽也是海軍，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:15.82,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,被一個堅強、善良的女海軍救下總是最好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:18.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我也這麼覺得。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.46,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這話我不想從你口中聽到。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，是你自己說的耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:30.11,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}新人妖拳法奧義，第九十九號活力食譜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:33.50,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,讓我們來復甦你們又冷又疲憊的身體吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:38.07,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,海豬荷爾蒙湯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.21,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果你們好幾天沒吃東西了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:43.44,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那就慢慢來，好好品嚐這頓飯，\N先從湯開始。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.13,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們真的餓壞了，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:56.59,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,桃，香吉士的菜是最棒的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.46,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.86,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我一點都不餓！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:05.67,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，等等你這小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.72,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你打算拿那盤菜怎麼樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我絕不原諒浪費食物的人，\N就算是小孩也一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.11,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我吃便是。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂…喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:19.16,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.52,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.57,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我覺得更有力氣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.86,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,多麼美味的食物！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.52,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,好吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.71,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,父親…！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.78,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,讓我們接受他們的食物吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:36.48,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,事實上，他們救了我的命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:40.34,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你可以信任這些人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:44.96,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你到現在什麼都沒吃，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.18,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你能忍到現在，做得很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:48.63,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,那一定很難熬。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:54.80,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,現在沒事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:59.27,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,讓我們相信其他人也同樣撐了過來。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:05.91,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,來，我們要繼續活下去，桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:08.78,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,是。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼了？\N是太好吃了所以害你哭嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:24.65,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不是啦你這白痴，他們顯然經歷了很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:26.26,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這些傢伙到底經歷了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:28.47,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:35.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,善與惡之間的界線怎麼了，你們這些混蛋？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.82,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,這是停戰，老兄。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:42.39,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那好吧，你們何不去油輪上拿點酒來？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.25,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,樂意之至。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:44.22,Main,Child,0,0,0,,也來點果汁！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.05,Main,Law,0,0,0,,喂，草帽仔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.74,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我們得趕快離開這個地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:51.90,Main,Law,0,0,0,,如果我們留下來吃東西，新的敵人就會出現。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.24,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.21,Main,Law,0,0,0,,去告訴其他人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:56.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:12:00.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,開派對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.67,Main,Zoro/Luffy/Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}乾杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:09.77,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,父親…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:14.21,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,武士不該讓任何人看見自己的眼淚。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:19.28,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,那是什麼意思啊，魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.50,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,乾杯，老兄。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:24.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:31.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一、二、三！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.41,Main,Child,0,0,0,,給你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:35.43,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,謝謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.67,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,摩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.52,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,斯莫格中將！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:13:00.04,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們要回到裡面去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:00.99,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:04.22,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們逼凱薩說出了毒瓦斯的弱點。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:08.15,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們的同伴還活著，我們還能救他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:12.57,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,你為什麼還活著，斯莫格？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.28,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:26.12,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,你不可能相信我會對你這種海賊信守承諾。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:31.26,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,但如果你真想讓我閉嘴，\N你有的是機會殺了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:36.26,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,你打算利用草帽做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:38.01,Main,Law,0,0,0,,利用？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:40.95,Main,Law,0,0,0,,被利用的人是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:44.78,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,你說的是四皇的哪一位？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.85,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,目標是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:49.91,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,百獸的凱多。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:54.91,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要第一個不是傑克斯，我就沒意見。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:14:00.08,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,因為我打算把他們全部打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:03.50,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,你想把他們全部打倒？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.39,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,那雖然或許跟我們的目標一致，\N但你太小看他們了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:13.12,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,他們是這片海域的皇帝，\N還為了地盤跟白鬍子本人交過手。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:19.37,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,其中，百獸的凱多\N被稱為世界上最強的生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.91,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！他根本不是人類？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:27.86,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,我們同盟的目的是要打倒凱多。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:30.31,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,我們計畫成功的機率…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.60,Flashbacks,Law,0,0,0,,嗯，最好假設它極其低。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.80,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼，真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.12,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,我們不該接受他的提議，魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:38.62,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,我懂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.98,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，我們就幹吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:47.08,Flashbacks,Nami,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:54.11,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我讓你活下來其實沒有什麼真正的理由，白獵。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:15:00.01,Main,Law,0,0,0,,順帶一提，我打算前往格林比特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:04.90,Main,Law,0,0,0,,不知道草帽一夥是不是我應付不來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:10.86,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}暴食！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:15.13,Main,Child,0,0,0,,你太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:16.45,Main,Child,0,0,0,,他會伸縮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.70,Main,Child,0,0,0,,好酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:20.20,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們是G-5。\N連哭鬧的小孩看到我們都會閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:34.40,Main,Smoker,0,0,0,,我以為你們要用那艘油輪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不，那不是我們在做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:43.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,娜美和喬巴說，沒確認孩子們安全離開之前，他們拒絕啟航。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,而我也懶得等\N另一艘海軍船開來這裡，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.03,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以用那個載孩子們走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:52.88,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,上船吧，孩子們！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:55.30,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們要帶你們回家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.56,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,喂喂，草帽一夥！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:16:00.99,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,如果油輪是我們的，那…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.34,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,這就是新的界線！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.80,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,想都別想越過它。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:08.11,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,這是善與惡之間的界線。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:10.30,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,懂了嗎？別再靠近了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,又來？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們剛剛不是還一起開派對嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:16.30,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,別當白痴了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:20.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,關於那個，我們真的很感激那頓飯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:23.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,但是，你們是海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:24.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,全人類之恥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.01,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,嘿喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:31.97,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.80,Main,Child,0,0,0,,娜美大姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:35.57,Main,Child,0,0,0,,喬巴君？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.68,Main,Child,0,0,0,,機器人在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:39.74,Main,Child,0,0,0,,咦？那些海賊大哥都跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:42.75,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,讓開，你們這些傢伙。你們很煩。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:44.00,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,是一道屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.00,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,別看那些海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:49.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們自己也根本就是海賊啊，G-5。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不過，看來他們都安全上船了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:55.26,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們是正義！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:58.81,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們殺光所有危害平民的海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:08.37,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,海賊是世界的人渣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:10.54,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們是正義！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.59,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,別讓孩子們看到他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.33,Flashbacks,Sanji,0,0,0,,快跑，你們這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:16.61,Flashbacks,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果你們不想死就快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:20.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他們說貝卡帕庫會幫他們\N解決糖果的問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:21.80,Main,Choppr,0,0,0,,真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.79,Main,Choppr,0,0,0,,那真令人安心。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:24.92,Main,Doran,0,0,0,,捲捲眉的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.51,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,你們擋路了，海軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:27.39,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,請讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:34.07,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你們之中任何想跟海賊道別的，都是壞孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:38.07,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,任何說謝謝的人，\N都會被丟下船留在島上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:39.87,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,聽好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:43.57,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,海賊是惡，海軍是善！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.07,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}海賊不可饒恕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:47.75,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}我們對抗所有海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:51.32,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,可是他們說他們會救我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.55,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,而且他們做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.06,0:17:59.32,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,即使他們對我們一無所知…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:05.18,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,我們這麼龐大，只會礙他們的事，但他們還是帶我們一起走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.62,Flashbacks,Mocha,0,0,0,,我想回家。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.16,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,我們很快就會回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.10,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,再撐一下下。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:14.60,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,即使這是一座從來沒人會來的無人島…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:15.94,Main,Doyo,0,0,0,,他們還是為了我們而來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:19.88,Flashbacks,Chopper,0,0,0,,我很抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:25.48,Flashbacks,Chopper,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉…我們沒能早點找到你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:29.15,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,海賊又髒又爛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:31.53,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,但海軍…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.69,Main,Doyo,0,0,0,,如果你們連我們離開時道個謝都不肯讓我們說…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.33,Main,Doyo,0,0,0,,那海軍乾脆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.30,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,等等！我道歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.11,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}對海賊說不！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.50,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}對海軍說好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:49.52,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,而且不只如此！\N海軍正義又勇敢，而且{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.79,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,立刻給我停止！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.04,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,太丟臉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:06.36,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,可…可是塔西姬，如果我們不繼續罵他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:12.85,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們最後就會…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:17.75,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}真的喜歡上這些不法之徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:22.91,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,就…就算他們是海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.37,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真是群奇怪的海軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.15,Main,Doran,0,0,0,,喂各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:46.16,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,謝謝你們救了我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.57,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,等我們長大，我們一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.57,0:19:51.49,Main,Children,0,0,0,,{\i1}要成為海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:53.74,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.95,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那麼，我們出發吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:06.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，那傢伙要跟我們一起走嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:09.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喔對了，我們還沒跟你們說過同盟的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:13.42,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,草帽，做好覺悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.46,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,下次見面時，我們就是敵人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:19.27,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,回頭見！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:22.44,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我們一定會抓到你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:34.89,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你們這些臭小子似乎有惡魔般的運氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:39.49,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,沒想到這條天空之路會在這裡終結。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:51.77,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,少主！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.18,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:56.37,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,那個混蛋羅真的背叛了我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.24,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,對不起咑酥呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:20:59.68,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,我想以死謝罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:04.51,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,我被需要卻幫不上忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:09.21,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,這不是我們油輪上的救生艇嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.97,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,我好羞愧咑酥呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:12.94,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,我們已經盡力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:16.68,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,沒關係。什麼都不必說。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:19.82,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你們只是聽從我的命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:22.09,Main,Law,0,0,0,,這倒是個驚喜。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:26.20,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我沒想到老大會親自出馬。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.98,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,是你嗎，羅？好久不見。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:31.47,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你就不能留下來讓我們當面見一面嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.47,0:21:35.79,Main,Law,0,0,0,,如果你在找凱薩，他在我這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:40.08,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,喬…喬卡，請救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:44.48,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,貝比5和巴法羅的身體在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:45.72,Main,Law,0,0,0,,誰知道呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.19,Main,Law,0,0,0,,那不是我們要談的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:49.92,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我們來做個交易。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.82,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,喂羅，別逞強了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:03.03,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,小鬼別想裝大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:05.77,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你現在人在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:08.54,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你最好別惹我。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:10.16,Main,Law,0,0,0,,惹？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:13.65,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你最重要的交易夥伴是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:19.32,Main,Law,0,0,0,,四皇之一。\N大海賊，百獸的凱多。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.32,0:22:24.59,Main,Law,0,0,0,,該擔心別惹他的人是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:31.88,Main,Law,0,0,0,,如果他發現你再也做不出SMILE了，你覺得會怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:35.39,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他不是個能讓你談判的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.55,Main,Law,0,0,0,,那會是一場殘酷的戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.55,0:22:40.06,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,少主，您的臉…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:43.27,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你會被殺死。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.27,0:22:46.90,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你這玩笑開得太過火了，羅。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.15,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,我要怎麼做你才肯把凱薩還回來？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:50.91,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,你的條件是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:54.79,Main,Law,0,0,0,,放棄你七武海的身分。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:59.00,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,真是個放肆的小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.57,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,那樣我們就沒辦法繼續待在德雷斯羅薩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:08.73,Main,Law,0,0,0,,拋棄你過去這十年來得到的一切，回去當個普通海賊。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.73,0:23:15.11,Main,Law,0,0,0,,當然，如果你那麼做，\N海軍總部的大將就會追捕你。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.90,0:23:19.78,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你的期限是明天的早間新聞。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:27.72,Main,Law,0,0,0,,如果我看到你退出了七武海，我就會再聯絡你。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:32.62,Main,Law,0,0,0,,如果什麼都沒有，那一切談判就此告吹。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:35.13,Main,Law,0,0,0,,再見。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:38.90,Main,Doflamngo,0,0,0,,喂等等，羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.93,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,少主！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

